{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Mountains</b> — according to the rule of גשם." "And the sense of <b>mountains</b> — they are the proud, and it says they melted, even though they are dry, contrary to nature." "And the sense of <b>Adonai</b> — because the proud are not the lords of the earth in truth."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 97, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:27.865776373Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}